azil)",wY="Portuguese (Portugal)",mw="Romanian",gw="Russian",fw="Slovak",hw="Slovenian";var _w="Serbian (Cyrillic)",bw="Serbian (Latin)",yw="Swedish",vw="Thai",xw="Turkish",Tw="Ukranian",SY="Ukranian",CY="Urdu",ww="Vietnamese",EY="Vietnamese (Vietnam)";var Sw="Chinese (Simplified)",Cw="Chinese (Traditional, Hong Kong SAR)",Ew="Chinese (Traditional)";var AY="Manage cookies",zd="Manage email preferences";var kY="We are working hard to migrate your course history and achievements to Learn. At this time, however, only activity completed in Learn will appear here.",PY=`To view your full transcript and/or the badges you've earned in the Microsoft Educator Center and Learn, please go to your <a href="https://education.microsoft.com/profile">MEC profile</a>.`;var IY="Microsoft Employee Privacy Notice",LY="You have signed in with an account associated to an organization ({email}). By becoming a member, <strong>you understand and acknowledge</strong> that your Microsoft Learn membership means our network of sites and applications will record, and track your achievements and activities and we may share your results and activities with your organization. Additionally, your username, display name, profile picture, affiliation, achievements and activities will be publicly visible. You can hide your achievements and activities under settings.<br/><br/>After you create your profile, we recommend you link a personal account so that you can access your learning progress regardless of your employment status. You can link additional accounts in the Account Management section of the profile settings.";var RY="Microsoft Learn will send email to you at the email you provide below.";var lm="Microsoft Privacy Notice",MY="You need to agree with the Microsoft Privacy Notice to keep your profile and relating data.";var DR="{numberOfMinutes} min";var Aw="{numberOfMinutes} minutes";var l_="1 minute";var Ii="Module";var NR="All module assessment results";var $R="N/A means either not all module assessments exist or there is no pass record. All Learning Paths in this table are complete.";var OR="N/A in the module assessment result column means either the module assessment doesn't exist or there's no pass record for it. All modules in this table are complete.";var UR="Module assessment passed",DY="All module assessments passed";var qR="Module assessment result";var Ca="Modules";var c_="More";var Oo="Next";var Ea="No",kw="New collection",FR="Newest",HR="Oldest";var NY='No items in this section. Move items here from other sections or add items from the <a href="{link}">Learn training browse page</a>.';var $Y="No suggestions";var OY="No, thanks";var cm="{number} item",Rl="{number} items";var UY="of";var zR="Off",dn="OK",qY="OK, got it.",FY="Go to the {title} page";var HY="Based on your {section} selections, start learning with the following recommendations.";var zY="Let's customize your experience on Microsoft Learn!";var BY="Explore {topic} hub pages",VY="We were unable to match your selections to recommendations",YY='Thank you for selecting the items you are interests in. Your selections are saved to your profile. Unfortunately, we do not have any matching recommendations at this time. You can "Restart from beginning" to add more selections or check back at a later date to see if our recommendations have changed for you.',GY="Oops! You did not fill out the survey",BR="In order to give you custom recommendations you must fill out the survey. Please select the link on the bottom labeled \u201CRestart from beginning\u201D to begin the survey. Answer to the best of your ability for the most accurate recommendations.",VR="If you do not want tailored recommendations at this time, you can still browse!",d_="Browse training";var jY="Please make at least one selection";var YR="Restart from beginning";var u_="Select all that apply",WY="Select the best response",Pw="Select the option that you most identify with";var QY="Select 1-3 Products you're interested in";var KY="Select 1-3 Careers you're interested in",JY="Select 1-3 Subjects you're interested in",XY="Answer the following set of questions to the best of your ability. Knowing your interests, we will provide custom recommendations and tweak some pages of the site to reflect your interests.",ZY="What are you interested in learning about?",GR="Is there something in {subtopic} you want to focus on?",e3="So, you're interested in products. Which product(s) would you like to focus on?",t3="You're interested in {experienceTopic}. What would you say your experience level is with it?",o3="So, you're interested in careers. Which career(s) would you like to focus on?",n3="You're interested in being a {experienceTopic}. What would you say your experience level is?",r3="So, you're interested in subjects. Which subject(s) would you like to focus on?",i3="You're interested in {experienceTopic}. What would you say your experience level is?",a3="What would you say is your current career level?",s3="Just getting started (0 years)",l3="Early career (0 - 5 years)",c3="Mid career (5 - 10 years)",d3="Advanced career (10+ years)",u3="What type of training content do you want to engage with?",p3="Self-paced (online)",m3="Instructor-led (in-person/virtual)";var p_="On this page";var g3="Open search";var f3='I will receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Microsoft Privacy Statement.</a>',h3="I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the Microsoft Privacy Statement.",_3='I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Microsoft Privacy Statement.</a>',b3="I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the Microsoft Privacy Statement.",y3='I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Microsoft Privacy Statement.</a>',v3='Participation requires transferring your personal data to other countries in which Microsoft operates, including the United States. By submitting this form, you agree to the transfer of your data outside of China. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>',jR="I agree to receiving marketing information and use of my personal information for marketing purposes (required):",x3='<div class="content"><ul><li><span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">Consent to Receive Marketing</span>: The information collected may be used for Microsoft to send you information, tips, and offers about Microsoft Learn and other Microsoft products and services. </li><li> Items of Personal Information to be Collected: First Name, Last Name, Email Address, Phone Number, Company name and size, Job Title, Country/Region of residence, and any other fields visible on this form. </li><li>Purpose of Collection and Use: <span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">To contact you for marketing purposes </span></li><li> Retention/Use Period of Personal Information: <span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">As long as needed to provide the service(s) you are requesting </span></li></ul></div> You have the right to refuse the collection and use of personal information for marketing purposes, and receiving marketing information as set forth above. However, if you refuse, you may not be able to receive the benefits described under Purpose of Collection & Use. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>';var dm="Select a country/region";var um="Skills measured";var T3="Optional";var Iw="{label} (optional)";var WR="Other";var w3="Overall, how satisfied or dissatisfied are you with Microsoft Learn?";var Lw="Page {pageNumber} of {numberOfPages}";var S3="pagination";var m_="Past {numberOfDays} days";var Xr="Plan";var C3="Please fill out this field.",pm="Please provide an email address.";var E3="Print";var Rw="Preview";var mm="Previous";var A3="Private";var k3="{productName} users:";var g_="Profile",Mw='Ask or answer a question in <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/answers">the community</a>',f_='Catch up on the latest <a href="https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/microsoft-learn-blog/bg-p/MicrosoftLearnBlog">site news</a>',P3="Cloud Skills Challenge",h_='Explore <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/docs/">the documentation</a>',__='Learn skills with <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training">step-by-step guidance</a>';var I3="Complete a learning path or module to get a trophy or badge. Your achievements will show here.",L3="Start learning new skills. Your activities will show here.",R3="Welcome back! We haven't seen you in a while. Start learning new skills.";var QR="Start learning new skills.",M3="When you complete a challenge, your achievements will show up here.";var D3="When you complete a course, your achievements will show up here.",N3="When you participate in Microsoft Learn events, contribute to Microsoft Learn content, or engage in other initiatives, your achievements will show up here.",$3="When you complete a plan, your achievements will show up here.";var O3="Follow your favorite threads, tags, and users.",U3="When you complete a learning path, your achievements will show up here.",q3="When you complete a module, your achievements will show up here.";var F3="Start learning new skills.",H3="Complete a learning path or module and a transcript of your activity will be shown here.";var Dw="Q&A";var z3="asked";var B3="answers",V3="comments";var Y3="votes";var G3="Maximum number of attachments exceeded. Please select up to {maximumCount} attachments.";var j3="Maximum number of mentions exceeded. Please select up to {maximumCount} mentions.";var W3="User is already suspended. Please refresh the page.",Q3="User is not suspended. Please refresh the page.";var K3="You cannot take this action because your account has been suspended due to a violation of our Code of Conduct. Your account was manually reported or identified through automated detection before action was taken. Please refer to our Code of Conduct for more information.";var KR="Report a concern",JR="Report reason";var J3=`<a class='docs-sign-in' href="#">Sign in</a> to opt into email updates on your reported concern`,X3="Allow Microsoft to contact me about this report",Z3="Full Name",e6="Email",t6='We will contact you through your personal account <span id="report-msa-email-account" class="font-weight-bold">{email}</span>',o6='Microsoft is committed to helping our users and to protecting your privacy. You may read the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a> if you would like more information on how we protect personal data.';var gm="Question",n6="Question author";var r6="Read more";var An="Reference";var XR="Register";var Cs="Remove",i6="Remove {itemName}";var fm="Renew";var Bd="Report a concern",a6="Select reason",s6="Adult and sexual",l6="Child sexual exploitation and abuse imagery",c6="Coordination of harm";var d6="Bullying and harassment",u6="Graphic violence and gore",p6="Hate speech and discrimination",m6="Non-consensual intimate imagery & intimate extortion";var g6="Other Terms of Use or Code of Conduct violation";var f6="Profanity and vulgarity",h6="Sexual solicitation";var _6="Suicide and self-injury",b6="Terrorism and violent extremism",y6="Trafficking",v6="Violent threats, incitement, and glorification of violence";var Nw="Reputation point",$w="Reputation points";var hm="Required fields are marked with an asterisk";var x6="{numberOfResults} result",T6="{numberOfResults} results";var Vd="Resume";var Ye="Save";var Ml="Save successful.";var w6="Skill";var ZR="Plans",Ow="AI-generated plans",S6="We use AI to help you create a tailored learning plan that considers your unique needs and provides the most relevant content.",eM="Add to plan",tM="Added to Plans",C6="Manage {title} in Plans",E6="Add {title} to a plan",A6="Create a plan",Uw="Create plan with AI",oM="Copy plan";var k6="Microsoft Learn plans",P6="To create a plan, go to your collections page and either select an existing collection or create a new collection. Then go to that collection's page and you can save that collection as a plan.",I6="Milestone {number}",L6='Added to <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">{collectionName}</a>',R6='Added to <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">Plans</a>';var M6='Removed from <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">{collectionName}</a>',D6='Removed from <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">Plans</a>';var N6='<a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">Plans</a> updated';var $6="Choose a different name for your plan",O6="Copy Link";var U6="Create a plan from a collection",qw="Manage";var Dl="Leave",Fw="Leave plan",Hw="Are you sure you want to leave this plan?",zw="You'll lose all records of your progress, and won't appear in the creator's report.",Bw="Yes, leave",q6="Enter a title";var F6="Sorry, this plan is private.",H6="The creator of this plan has marked it as private and it is not currently visible to other users.",z6="You can review your Plans in your user profile.",B6="View your Plans",V6='You can also return to <a href="{url}" class="color-text text-decoration-underline">Plans</a>.',Y6="Plan unavailable",G6="This plan does not exist or was removed.",j6="If this link was shared with you, request a new link.",Yd="Completed",nM="Created",Vw="Plans",Yw="A plan allows learners to progress through a set of milestones to achieve learning outcomes. You can invite learners to your plan and track their progress.",_m="Started";var W6="You have not completed any Plans",Q6="You have not created any Plans. To create a plan, go to your collections page and either select an existing collection or create a new collection. Then go to that collection's page and you can save that collection as a plan.",K6="You have not started any Plans",bm="Official plan";var J6="You have no plans.";var X6="Plan not found. Please refresh the page.",Z6="One or more milestones is empty or is missing the recommended days to complete. Please fix these issues before publishing the plan.",eG="Plan details";var tG="Delete plan",oG="To delete your plan, ensure no users are joined to it. All users must drop the plan first.",nG="Are you sure that you want to delete the following plan?",rG="Yes, delete plan";var ym="Invite learners",rM="Copy invite link",iG="Link copied to clipboard",aG="Delete learning group",sG="You are about to delete the following learning group: <strong>{learningGroupName}</strong>. Do you want to proceed?",lG="Group deleted",cG="Groups",b_="Group name",dG="Individuals";var uG="A learning group is a name that allows you to identify a group of learners in your progress report; learners will not see this name.<br/><br/>Creating a learning group generates a unique link to your plan for the specific group of learners.";var iM="New learning group",pG="Please enter a name for this learning group",mG="Your invitation to start {planTitle} plan on Microsoft Learn",gG="Start your plan and begin your learning journey today.",fG="You have been invited to start the {planTitle} plan on Microsoft Learn.",hG="A plan is a set of curated and organized content on Microsoft Learn with milestones designed to help you to achieve learning outcomes.",_G="By completing this plan, you\u2019ll achieve the following learning outcomes:",bG="Start your plan today!",vm="View progress",yG="Download this file to view a list of learners and their progress.",aM="Download CSV",vG="The file contains the following information:",xG="Learner group",TG="Learn username",wG="Start date",SG="End date",CG="Items completed",EG="Items total",Gw="Learning outcomes",AG="Edit learning outcomes",kG="A learning outcome is specific knowledge, skills, or expertise that the learner will get from completing this plan.",PG="Tip: Begin each learning outcome with a verb. Each outcome should finish the sentence \u201CUpon completion of this plan, learners will be able to...\u201D";var IG="Outcome 1",LG="Outcome 2 (optional)",RG="Outcome 3 (optional)",MG="Outcome {number}",DG="Convert to an official plan",NG="Convert a plan to an official plan",$G="An official plan should be used when you want your plan to <strong>represent Microsoft</strong> and if you would like to include links that are external to Microsoft Learn. Always ensure that your plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence. <strong>Once an official plan is published, it cannot be altered.</strong>",OG="To preserve any external links from an underlying Official Collection or plan, please convert to an official plan.",UG="An official plan represents Microsoft, so please ensure that your published plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence.";var jw="This plan has been submitted to be localized",qG="The plan is complete and proofread",FG="Thank you for submitting your official plan for localization.",HG="Mark as completed",zG="Milestone",BG="Add milestone",VG="Edit milestone";var YG="New milestone",GG="Days to milestone:",jG="1 milestone",WG="{numberOfMilestones} milestones";var QG="Milestone completed";var KG="Move to";var JG="Please confirm all milestones have a title and days to complete. You may need to expand each milestone.";var XG="Mark as complete?",ZG="Do you want to mark it complete? Once you mark it as complete, you won't be able to review it again.",ej="Welcome!",tj="To start this plan, you have to share your plan progress data with the creator of the plan. The data that will be shared is: the dates that you start and complete the plan and how many items of the total you have completed at any point in time. Your data will be associated with your public Learn username.",oj="Do you agree to share your progress?",nj="Yes, I agree to share my progress",rj="If you would like to receive useful emails to guide and encourage you through your Plans journey, please go to your Profile Settings page and provide a contact email for notifications.",ij="Save all items in this plan as a new",aj="Please sign in to add this to your plan.",sj="You created a plan",lj="You edited a plan",cj="You completed a plan",dj="You started a plan",uj="You don't have any plans yet.",sM="A learner group with this name exists already. Please enter a different name";var pj="Reported plan",mj='A concern has been reported on this plan and it is currently under Microsoft review. Please refer to our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> for more information.',gj="We use AI to help you create a personalized plan.";var lM="Redeem your code now.";var fj="It looks like you have already redeemed this code.<br/>Go to your achievements page to view your achievements.";var hj="This code has hit its maximum.<br/>If you feel you are getting this message in error, please contact your instructor.",_j="We cannot find this code in our system. Please contact your instructor.";var bj="Copy Link";var yj="Enter your code to add your achievement(s) to your profile";var cM="We could not redeem your code at this time. Please try again.";var vj="Add your achievement(s) to your profile";var xj="Redeem",dM="Redeem your code";var Tj="e.g. A2CD34",wj="It might take a couple of minutes for the badges to appear.",Sj="Codes are for our instructor-led training courses. Missing your code? Please contact your instructor.";var Cj="You are signed in as",Ej="We\u2019ve added your achievement(s) to your profile!",uM="More information on code";var Aj="Please enter a valid code.",y_="View profile",pM="Have an achievement code?";var Aa="Search";var kj="Search previous versions";var Ww="Section";var Pj="Select a country or region";var ka="Settings",Pa="Share",Ij="I earned my {achievementTitle} {achievementType}! I\u2019m so proud to be celebrating this achievement and hope this inspires you to start your own @MicrosoftLearn journey!";var Lj="[Shared Article] {articleTitle}";var Rj="Share this achievement";var Mj="Share to your feed:";var Dj="Share to LinkedIn",Nj="Share to LinkedIn feed",xm="Share via",$j="Add to LinkedIn Profile",Oj="Congratulations on earning your credential! Add it to your profile by clicking the button below:",Qw="Just earned my {credentialName}! Excited for what comes next.";var Uj="Show less",mM="Show more";var Gd="Sign in";var Kw="Sign in to start",Tm="Sign out";var qj="Site";var Fj='{count} results for "{searchPhrase}"';var Hj=`We couldn't find any results matching "{searchPhrase}"`;var Jw="Skip";var Xw="Hmm, something went wrong",Ke="Something went wrong. Please try again.";var zj="Sort by:";var Zw="Sorted from newest to oldest";var jd="Start",Bj="Starts {startDate}",Vj="Start Date";var wm="Start Learning";var Yj="Status",gM="Step {step-index} of {step-count}",Gj="Manage {title} in study guides",jj="Add {title} in study guides";var fM="Subjects",Sm="Submit";var Wj="Suggestions",Qj="Suggestions will filter as you type";var Kj="Support";var hM="Tag";var eS="Tags";var Jj="Characters left";var Xj="External images can only be linked from certain websites. These image urls are not allowed: {urls}. Click to see full domain allowlist.",Zj="The file {fileName} is invalid. File type must be a valid gif, jpg, jpeg, or png image.",e9="The file {fileName} is too large. File size cannot exceed five megabytes.";var t9="{account} already has a profile",o9="You have reached your account limit",n9="No more than five school or work accounts can be linked to one profile. Please remove one account and try again.",r9="{account} linked",i9='To access your Learn profile, you must be able to sign in using at least one of the login accounts listed below. You may add up to five work or school login accounts <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/aad-user.svg"/></figure>. Adding a work or school account allows you to share your learning progress data with your organization and take advantage of any organizational exam discounts. We strongly recommend adding a personal Microsoft login account <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/msa-user.svg"/></figure> to your profile. This ensures that you maintain access to your learning history and credentials regardless of your employment or academic status. Only one personal login account is allowed.',a9="Don\u2019t lose your data, add your account to profile",s9="You already have a linked account in the same organization",l9="Remove this account?",c9="Removing this account will delete its data from your Learn profile and stop the associated organization from receiving your Learn data. Note that your Learn profile will not be deleted.",d9="{account} removed",u9="Add login account",p9="Please add another account and try again.";var m9=`You can only link accounts that don't have a registered profile. Please select a different account or see our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting#user-content-account-linking">troubleshooting guidance <span class="docon docon-navigate-external" aria-hidden="true"></span></a> for more details.`;var g9="Connected certification profile",f9="connected with certification profile";var h9="Other Learn login accounts",_9="You are adding a school or work account ({account}) to your profile. You understand and acknowledge that we may share your results and activities with your organization. You may choose to unlink this account at any time and your organization will stop receiving your learning progress data.",b9="You have linked this account already",y9="{account} is a personal account. Please select a school or work account.",Cm="Login account management";var tS="MCID",v9="You need at least one account linked to your profile.",x9="No accounts added",T9="Only one account per organization is supported.",w9="You can only have one personal account linked",S9="Profile is currently being merged",C9="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.";var E9="Select account",_M="Please select a different account",A9="Shared information (like name or picture) will keep the info from Profile 1.",k9="There is already a certification profile connected to this profile",P9="In order to continue, please contact customer support to remove the current certification profile to proceed.",I9="Your data will be <strong>merged into Profile 1</strong>.",L9="<strong>Editable information</strong> like your display name and interests can still be changed later.",bM="Notify me when merging is complete",R9="Merging profiles can take several minutes. We'll let you know when the process is complete. When you opt-in to this update, we may also send you personalized recommendations, helpful tips, or Q&A notifications.",M9="You'll get notifications at {email}.",D9="Your email is not currently set to receive notifications and will not be enrolled after the merge.",N9='<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/faq?pivots=profile">Learn more</a> about merging profiles.',$9="This profile has been locked",O9="This profile is currently locked and is being merged with another profile. Please sign-in to a different profile.",yM="Retry merge",vM="Terminate merge",U9="Here's what will happen",q9="Merge complete",F9="Profile 1",H9="Profile 2",z9="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",B9="Profile merge record not found",V9='Unable to find your profile merge. Please refresh the page. If the problem is still there, please contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/troubleshooting#report-feedback">customer support</a>.',Y9="A previous merge attempt is preventing this action",G9="One of the profiles you are trying to merge is currently being merged with another profile. Please log into both profiles to check the status.",j9="You're combining two Microsoft Learn profiles.",W9="Would you like to combine your learning data into one profile?",Q9="Merging your data is permanent and cannot be undone, but all your learning progress including achievements, skills, and certifications will be combined in one place.",K9="Your profiles have been successfully merged.",J9="We ran into a problem merging your source profile (username: {sourceUser}) to your destination profile (username: {destinationUser}).",X9="Some of your data might have been merged in the process, so it is expected if you find some data disappearing from your source profile and appearing on your destination profile.",Z9="You can choose one of the following actions:",e5="<b>{terminateMergeText}</b>: It will stop and quit the merge process. You will be able to use both profiles as usual and can trigger a new merge at any time. The data that already merged will remain on your destination profile.",t5="<b>{retryMergeText}</b>: It will re-run the merging process for you once more. Your source profile will be locked during the merging process.",o5="Merging in progress. It may take several minutes to complete.",n5="Your merge has been terminated.",r5="Clicking 'Accept and continue' will begin the merging process. You can still use the profile you are currently signed-in with, but your other profile will be locked.",i5="We'll send you an update at {email} when your profiles have been successfully merged.",a5="You'll still be able to <strong>sign in with all accounts</strong> on both profiles.",s5="Your activity feed shows up to 30 interactions over the past 30 days.",l5="Keep up the hard work! Only {number} left on this module.",c5="You joined Microsoft Learn today. Welcome!",d5="You earned a credential by passing a skilling assessment.",u5="You earned a credential by passing exams required by a certification.",p5="You earned a badge by completing a module.",m5="You earned a trophy by completing a learning path.";var g5="Well done! You completed a module.",f5="You passed the renewal assessment for a certification",h5="You started a module",xM="{displayName} accepted an answer to your question",TM="{displayName} answered a question",wM="{displayName} asked a question",SM="{displayName} left a comment",CM="{displayName} made an edit",EM="{displayName} modified the {activityType}",AM="{displayName} suggested feedback",kM="{displayName} voted";var _5="Upload limit exceeded. Please try again later.",b5="Introduction",y5="Products",v5="Careers",x5="Subjects",T5="Get Recommendations",w5="Begin interest survey",oS="Edit interests",S5="Take/retake the user interest survey to help personalize recommendations and pages to your current interest and skill level.";var nS="{AppliedSkills} Earned",rS="{AppliedSkills} Attempted",C5="Appointment",E5="Attempted";var A5="Confirmation code",k5='If you need assistance, contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/certifications/help">certification support</a>.',P5="Coming up soon",I5="Copy Credential Link",iS="Earned on";var aS="Expired",v_="Extend to",sS="Failed",L5="Get support";var PM="Go to the exam",IM="has successfully achieved the certification",R5="In person",M5="items";var D5="Last attempted on",LM="Legal name",N5="Location";var RM="Online",lS="Passed",Em="Past exams",Am="Past renewal assessments";var cS="Provided by";var $5="Renewal assessment",O5="Renewed on";var U5="Reschedule",d