ete your profile",yW="The name that appears on your public profile, printable achievements, certificates, and transcript.",fS="Download your data";var vW="Invalid username. Username must start with a letter or number and can contain non-consecutive dashes. It must be 4 to 40 characters in length.",xW="Legal name is too short",hS="Legal name",TW="We <strong>strongly recommend you add a personal account to your Learn profile</strong> to ensure you can continue to access your learning progress regardless of your employment or academic status. You can have up to five school or work accounts and one personal account linked to your profile to use for signing in.";var wW="Checking this box indicates that you acknowledge your legal name to be entered correctly.",SW="Congratulations! You have successfully created your profile.",_S="Enter your legal name EXACTLY as it appears on your Government Issued ID. You must take this ID to the certification exam and the proctor will check that they match. If you don't have a legal last name, please enter _ in the last name field.",Nl="First name",$l="Last name";var Ol="Middle name",CW="Required to register for certification exams.";var EW='Your legal name change request will require further review. Please contact <a href="{link}">Credential Support</a> to modify your legal name.';var bS="Personal info, username and URL",AW="{name}'s profile is private";var w_="Edit display name";var yS="Settings for Print";var kW="Your profile will be set to private. Learn badges, trophies, and Q&A contributions will be hidden on your public profile, and shared achievements will not be viewable. Are you sure you want to hide your achievements and contributions?",PW="Your profile will be set to private",vS="Privacy Settings";var IW="When private mode is on, your display name, Learn achievements, and Q&A contributions are hidden on your public profile. In addition, shared achievements and shared credentials will not be viewable.",LW="Private mode is on. 