ting registration, you will not be able to post or ask a question on Q&A.",IQ="AI Skills Navigator",LQ="Your unified profile for AI Skills Navigator and Microsoft Learn",RQ="This profile works across both AI Skills Navigator and Microsoft Learn. You can sign in using a personal or work account to create your AI Skills Navigator profile, and associate other accounts later. Your display name and contact preferences can be updated anytime and will sync across both platforms.",MQ="Continue to AI Skills Navigator",DQ="Q&A email notifications",NQ="Control whether to receive email from Microsoft Q&A. Includes mention, moderation, and follow email notifications. You\u2019ll still receive administrative emails even if this setting is turned off.";var $Q="Follow questions you\u2019ve asked",OQ="Follow questions you\u2019ve answered",UQ="Follow questions you\u2019ve commented on",qQ="Follow questions with tags you\u2019re following";var FQ="Q&A email notifications",OM="Q&A email preferences";var HQ="Private message notifications",zQ="Receive an email when someone sends you a private message.";var BQ="Following tags",VQ="Following users",YQ="Following Q&A threads",GQ="Mention email notifications",jQ="Receive an email when someone mentions you using @display name notation.";var WQ="Moderation email notifications",QQ="Receive an email when a new post has entered moderation.";var KQ='<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/answers/index.html?filters=myActivity">Visit Q&A</a> for all questions and feedback',JQ="You followed the {activityType}",XQ="Followers",ZQ="Receive email when someone follows you",e8="Questions",t8="Receive email when a question is posted on a tag you follow",o8="Receive email when a question you follow is edited",n8="Receive email when questions you follow do not have any answers",r8="Answers",i8="Receive email when an answer is posted on a question you follow",a8="Receive email when an answer is edited on a question you follow",s8="Receive email when an answer i